(* Spec: Vortex Echo v1, the field phase of the vortex export pair on the exact bytes of vortex/core/ve_core.wasm (sha256 72fe0ba2). VE_VK_OK: the named premise ve_vk_ok of ve_vort.spec holds for the explicit field function ve_vk (ve_vk_defs.ml, defined from the code: normalisation by the 32-step integer square root and div_s, the regularised Biot-Savart pair sums in wrapping i64 in the compiled order, rounding (acc + 2^35) >>s 36); both prefixes pc 21..1305 (from the first instruction) reach pc 1305 without trap, VD = ve_vk(model, source), model / VA / VB unchanged, only locals and scratch written. VE_VK_OK_SAT: the premise is satisfiable. The whole exports from pc 21 without premise: apply is the Fredkin step with kick ve_vk, unapply its inverse, unapply after apply restores VA and VB (VE_VORT_INVERSE_VK), n substeps (VE_VORT_STEPS_INVERSE_VK). Witnesses for the model-level premises: VE_LOG_OK_SAT (ve_log_ok at tick 0 with the empty log), VE_RUN_OK_SAT (a state with ve_run_ok and ve_step_ok). *)
theorem VE_VK_OK
 `ve_vk_ok ve_vk`;;
theorem VE_VK_OK_SAT
 `?VK. ve_vk_ok VK`;;
theorem VE_VORT_APPLY_CORRECT_VK
 `!N (mdl:num->int32) (va:num->int32) (vb:num->int32).
     mdl 1 = word N /\ 1 <= N /\ N <= 640
     ==> ensures wasm
          (\s. read wcode s = ve_vort_apply_mc /\ read wpc s = word 21 /\
               read wstatus s = WRunning /\ read wstack s = [] /\
               read wlabels s = [] /\ read warity s = 0 /\
               read wmemsize s = 2097152 /\
               (!k. k < 1024 ==> read (wmem :> bytes32 (word (16640 + 4 * k))) s = mdl k) /\
               (!m. m < 3 * N ==> read (wmem :> bytes32 (word (1114112 + 4 * m))) s = va m) /\
               (!m. m < 3 * N ==> read (wmem :> bytes32 (word (1122304 + 4 * m))) s = vb m))
          (\s. read wstatus s = WDone /\ read wstack s = [] /\
               (!m. m < 3 * N ==> read (wmem :> bytes32 (word (1114112 + 4 * m))) s = vb m) /\
               (!m. m < 3 * N ==> read (wmem :> bytes32 (word (1122304 + 4 * m))) s = word_add (va m) (ve_vk mdl vb m)))
          (MAYCHANGE [wpc] ,, MAYCHANGE [wstack] ,, MAYCHANGE [wlabels] ,,
           MAYCHANGE [wstatus] ,,
           MAYCHANGE [wlocal 0; wlocal 1; wlocal 2; wlocal 3; wlocal 4; wlocal 5; wlocal 6; wlocal 7; wlocal 8; wlocal 9; wlocal 10; wlocal 11; wlocal 12; wlocal 13; wlocal 14; wlocal 15; wlocal 16; wlocal 17; wlocal 18; wlocal 19; wlocal 20; wlocal 21; wlocal 22; wlocal 23; wlocal 24; wlocal 25; wlocal 26; wlocal 27; wlocal 28; wlocal 29] ,,
           MAYCHANGE [wmem :> bytes(word 1114112,16384)] ,,
           MAYCHANGE [wmem :> bytes(word 1966080,73728)])`;;
